//  Name

        Name  Creator

//  Classes

      Class  Structure
      Class  Class
      Class  Class Attribute
      Class  Relation
      Class  Relation Class
      Class  Item
      Class  Item Attribute
      Class  Related Item
      Class  Related List

      //  For  Methods

            Class  Class Method
            Class  Item Method

//  Attributes

      Structure  -->  Name  (  String  )
      Structure  -->  Folder  (  String  )
      Structure  -->  Debug Member  (  String  )

      Class  -->  Class Name  (  String  )

      Class Attribute  -->  Name  (  String  )
      Class Attribute  -->  Type  (  String  )

      Relation Class  -->  Plural  (  Boolean  )
      Relation Class  -->  Name  (  String  )
      Relation Class  -->  Direction  (  Long  )    //  Quick  &  Dirty  solution,  substituting  Relation Class  ->  Relation ( as relation class a )  =  Something

      Item Attribute  -->  Value  (  String  )

      //  For  Methods

            Class Method  -->  Name  (  String  )
            Item Method  -->  Name  (  String  )

//  Relations

      Structure  (  Structure  )    1  -->  n    Class  (  Classes  )
      Structure  (  Structure  )    1  -->  n    Relation  (  Relations  )

      Class  (  Class  )    1  -->  n    Class Attribute  (  Class Attributes  )

      Relation  (  Relation ( as relation class a )  )    1  -->  1    Relation Class  (  Relation Class A  )
      Relation  (  Relation ( as relation class b )  )    1  -->  1    Relation Class  (  Relation Class B  )

      Relation Class  (  As Relation Class  )    n  -->  1    Class  (  Class  )
      Relation Class  (  As Other Relation Class  )    1  -->  1    Relation Class  (  Other Relation Class  )    //  Quick  &  Dirty  Other  Relation  Class  for  Quick  &  Dirty  Synchronization  1  ->  n  for  the  Procedures  Project

      Item  (  As Item  )    n  -->  1    Class  (  Class  )
      Item  (  Item  )    1  -->  n    Item Attribute  (  Item Attributes  )
      Item  (  Parent Item  )    1  -->  n    Related Item  (  Related Items  )
      Item  (  Item  )    1  -->  n    Related List  (  Related Lists  )

      Item Attribute  (  As Item Attribute  )    n  -->  1    Class Attribute  (  Class Attribute  )    //  Backward relation ridiculous to maintain

      Related Item  (  As Related Item  )    n  -->  1    Relation Class  (  Relation Class  )
      Related Item  (  As Related Item  )    n  -->  1    Item  (  Item  )

      Related List  (  As Relation List  )    n  -->  1    Relation Class  (  Relation Class  )
      Related List  (  As Related List Item  )    n  -->  n    Item  (  Items  )    //  Backward relation ridiculous to maintain

      Class  (  -  )    1  -->  n  Relation Class  (  Related Classes  )

      //  For  Methods

            Class  (  Class  )    1  -->  n    Class Method  (  Class Methods  )
            Item  (  Item  )    1  -->  n    Item Method  (  Item Methods  )
            Item Method  (  As Item Method  )    n  -->  1    Class Method  (  Class Method  )    //  Backward relation ridiculous to maintain
